<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
  h1, h2 { font-weight: bold; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  td, th { padding: 5px 0; text-align: left; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 16pt;">MINOR EVALUATION REQUEST FORM - International Business</h1>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4;">
    To request a Minor Evaluation please complete the Minor Evaluation Request Form. When completed, return it to the department for processing. Allow a minimum of ten working days for completion. Pick up your completed minor evaluation and add to your graduation application, that can be found on the Registrar's website, and turn in to the Registrar office OM 230.
    <br><br>
    (Note: all classes must be completed with the grade of C- or better)
  </p>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div>
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">STUDENT NAME:</p>
      <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">MAJOR/ CONCENTRATION:</p>
      <span data-field="major_concentration">{{ major_concentration }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <table style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 20%;">STUDENT ID# W:</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">REQUIRED BUSINESS</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">TRANSFER EQUIVALENTS</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">COURSE #</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;">COMPLETED</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;">PROGRESS</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;">REMAINING</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="student_id">{{ student_id }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="required_business_course_1">{{ required_business_course_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="transfer_equivalent_1">{{ transfer_equivalent_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="course_number_1">{{ course_number_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="completed_1">{{ completed_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="progress_1">{{ progress_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="remaining_1">{{ remaining_1 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <!-- Assuming only one row for this specific layout, but keeping structure for potential expansion -->
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">AND SELECT ONE OF THE FOLLOWING COURSES:</p>
    <table style="width: 50%;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 20%;">ECON</td>
        <td style="width: 20%;">207 (4)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 20%;">MGMT</td>
        <td style="width: 20%;">271 (4)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 20%;">MGMT</td>
        <td style="width: 20%;">311 (4)</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 10px;">
      All Business Literacy courses must be completed with a C- or better before you can declare an IB minor.
      Check the schedule for availability and prerequisites necessary for admission to the courses.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">REQUIRED INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS COURSES:</div>
  <table style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <tr>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> IBUS 370</td>
      <td>AND</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> IBUS 470</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">ELECTIVES</div>
  <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
    Choose ONE additional course with International content from:
  </p>
  <table style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <tr>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> IBUS 337</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> IBUS 372</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> IBUS 473</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> IBUS 474</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
    Choose a total of TWO courses from the following International courses listed, that were not taken above. Periodically additional courses may be available, check with your advisor to see if they are appropriate for the minor.
  </p>
  <table style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <tr>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> ACCT 451</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> ECON 337</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> ECON 343</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> ECON 360</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> ECON 361</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> ECON 365</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> ECON 366</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> ECON 385</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> ECON 388</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> ECON 389</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> ECON 462</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> ECON 463</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> FIN 442</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> MKTG 486</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> OPS 461</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> OPS 466</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> IBUS 337</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> IBUS 372</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> IBUS 473</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> IBUS 474</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> INTL 3XX OR 4XX</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td colspan="7"><input type="checkbox"> ADVISOR APPROVED COURSE W/ INT'L CONTENT</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p style="font-weight: bold;">Notes:</p>
  <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; height: 150px; margin-top: 5px; padding: 10px;">
    <!-- Placeholder for notes -->
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 50px; font-size: 9pt;">
    Updated July 2019
  </div>
</div>